OL,3,A'No light, no water, no heat':
OL,4,AUkrainians struggle with blackouts as
OL,5,ARussia hits power grid
OL,6,
OL,7,FDaryna Kulchytska is a mum under
OL,8,Fpressure. A single parent in a seventh
OL,9,Ffloor flat in Kyiv trying to feed two
OL,10,Flively kids and ensure they do their
OL,11,Fhomework. But Daryna also faces the
OL,12,Fadded strain of a deadline she can't
OL,13,Feven be certain of.
OL,15,FAll she knows is soon the lights will
OL,16,Fgo out, the sockets will lose power,
OL,17,Fthe wi-fi will drop, and the taps will
OL,18,Frun dry. Tonight, the electricity has
OL,19,Fkept flowing an hour longer than
OL,20,Fadvertised, but Daryna's still racing
OL,21,Fto serve dinner and finish her own work
OL,22,Ffrom home.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
