OL,3,A'No light, no water, no heat':
OL,4,AUkrainians struggle with blackouts as
OL,5,ARussia hits power grid
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The last few days it was only four or
OL,8,Ffive hours we had power, but it's not
OL,9,Fat the same times. For two hours we
OL,10,Fhave electricity, then for eight hours
OL,11,Fwe don't."
OL,13,FAs peace talks continue, with US envoys
OL,14,Fmeeting the Russian and Ukrainian
OL,15,Fleaders on Thursday, Ukrainians are
OL,16,Ffacing a rolling schedule of planned
OL,17,Fpower cuts because of intensified
OL,18,FRussian attacks on their energy grid.
OL,19,FUkraine has responded by striking
OL,20,FRussian oil refineries.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
